{
  "id": "ss.relic.heavyshell",
  "name": "Heavy shell",
  "description": "A domed shell of grey stone-slate far too big for what is under it: it spans the plate, sits at a slight list, and shows a thick pale lip where its edge has been cut, with a lit band across the upper left and two growth ridges following the dome. Beneath it only a flattened sliver of pale body shows, and a foot stub squeezed out at each end, the right one further because the shell is pressing that side down. Five armour and a fifth of the speed gone: the mass is the whole reading, so the shell is thick at the edge and the body is thin. It is not a snail — no spiral, no eyestalks, the shell is a cap and not a coil — and it stays clear of ss.relic.armor, whose helm has a horn and a hollow under it.",
